    "description": {
      "value": "You like a weapon that makes an impression almost as much as you like making an impression.\n\n**Multiclass Gunslinger characters:**\nGunslinger is a great fit for dexterous characters who want a weapon that hits hard from a distance, especially rangers and rogues who already have abilities that can make their first hit count. Spellcasters with true strike might favor firearms with the fatal property and gunslinger abilities that improve options for supporting their allies."
    },
